                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "🛑 Constantly on sale at -90%, and my passion for RPG Maker projects finally made me buy it. It's been 10y since its release, so many factors can be easily understood. The graphics are quite nice, although the font is bad. The tech. part, given the VX Ace capabilities, are terribly implemented. The game begins with nauseating screen shaking, transitions have no animation, door points work incorrectly, but the worst thing is that there are HARDLOCKS, and in ~30 min I managed to stumble upon two of them. The 1st completely disabled enemy battles (don't even know HOW), and the 2nd blocked the dungeon entrance (no reset). This is already a terrible start. I'll probably give the game another chance, but this shows that even old projects need testing. UPD: Played further. There are quite a few bugs that could be fixed in the maker itself (let’s even set aside the questionable game design choices). Why weren't there any patches?",
                        "timestamp_created": 1784136472,
